  "prefLabel": "Puc 1801.01 Applicant",
  "priorExpiration": "2015-07-31",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Puc 1801.01 “Applicant” means the general contractor, builder, owner or other person submitting an application to the commission or local authority having jurisdiction, as applicable, for certification of design compliance with the energy code.\n\nSource. #4702, eff 11-16-89; ss by #5643, eff 7-1-93; ss by #6879, eff 2-1-99, EXPIRED: 2-1-07\n\nNew. #8811, INTERIM, eff 2-2-07, EXPIRED: 8-1-07\n\nNew. #8958, eff 7-31-07, EXPIRED: 7-31-15\n\nNew. #10908, eff 8-8-15",
